# Raw spike captures. NEVER commit these directly — they come straight off the
# live Zepp API and carry credentials, identity and GPS coordinates.
#
# The safe path into the repo is:
#   spike/promote.py           excludes GPS workouts, re-scrubs the rest
#   tools/anonymize_fixtures.py strips identity, biometrics and hardware ids
#   tools/check_fixtures.py     verifies, and runs in CI
#
# Only tests/fixtures/zepp/ is tracked. Removing these rules reopens the leak.
spike/out/
spike/FINDINGS.md

# Local identifier map used by tools/anonymize_fixtures.py.
# Plaintext list of your own identifiers. Never commit.
tools/identities.local.json
